{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore procedurally generated levels, collecting unique weapons and items while fending off cave dwellers. </strong> <br><strong>Complete quests and alter your path as you descend deeper. </strong><br> <strong>Your only way out is down, but something waits for you in the depths of the Mine...</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><u><strong>Combat :</strong></u> <br>Use weapons, items, boxes, spikes, and minecarts to fend off cave dwellers and descend deeper into the abyss! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/Combat.gif?t=1748030189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Minecart level :</u></strong><br>Between levels, you'll ride a minecart where your choices influence the layout of the next level. Change the minecart\u2019s direction to shape what lies ahead!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/MinecartRide.gif?t=1748030189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Quests and Achievements :</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on quests as you progress through each level. whether it's delivering bones to a Monolith or offering spinach to the Vendor.  <br>Completing these challenges rewards you with unique items and may even alter how the next level is generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you could always decide that death is the only fitting end for these characters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/Quest.gif?t=1748030189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Virtue (<i>Coming Soon</i>) :</u></strong><br>Your decisions for helping or killing Neutral characters such as the Blacksmith or the Vendor, will effect the characters virtue, influencing the generation of the next level! (More to come)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you cannot afford to financially support the game, but still want to help:<br><strong><u>Wishlisting</u></strong> the game and following us on social media, REALLY does help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Thank you</u></strong> and I hope you enjoy playing Dwarfs Descent!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3150790?t=1748030189","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/0de6691481e84879983ac2d530e91d1b0193899a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748030189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/f84da9feaffe626aef4bae1c30b5eccf56f29de9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748030189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/f84da9feaffe626aef4bae1c30b5eccf56f29de9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748030189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3747310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore procedurally generated levels, collecting unique weapons and items while fending off cave dwellers. </strong> <br><strong>Complete quests and alter your path as you descend deeper. </strong><br> <strong>Your only way out is down, but something waits for you in the depths of the Mine...</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><u><strong>Combat :</strong></u> <br>Use weapons, items, boxes, spikes, and minecarts to fend off cave dwellers and descend deeper into the abyss! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/Combat.gif?t=1748030189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Minecart level :</u></strong><br>Between levels, you'll ride a minecart where your choices influence the layout of the next level. Change the minecart\u2019s direction to shape what lies ahead!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/MinecartRide.gif?t=1748030189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Quests and Achievements :</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on quests as you progress through each level. whether it's delivering bones to a Monolith or offering spinach to the Vendor.  <br>Completing these challenges rewards you with unique items and may even alter how the next level is generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, you could always decide that death is the only fitting end for these characters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150790/extras/Quest.gif?t=1748030189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Virtue (<i>Coming Soon</i>) :</u></strong><br>Your decisions for helping or killing Neutral characters such as the Blacksmith or the Vendor, will effect the characters virtue, influencing the generation of the next level! (More to come)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you cannot afford to financially support the game, but still want to help:<br><strong><u>Wishlisting</u></strong> the game and following us on social media, REALLY does help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Thank you</u></strong> and I hope you enjoy playing Dwarfs Descent!</p>","developers":["Line In The Sand Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.